<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 6.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 6.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	 19.49     2.36</p>
<p> 2   Central Norseman     13.33     0.90</p>
<p> 3   Telecasters Nqld     13.21     5.30</p>
<p> 4   Pac Mutal Aust	 12.45     2.41</p>
<p> 5   Kurts (P) Prop	 10.34     1.45</p>
<p> 6   Multistack	     10.34     0.29</p>
<p> 7   Prime Credit Tr	10.32     0.95</p>
<p> 8   Prop Income Inv	10.31     0.99</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	  10.11     0.90</p>
<p>10   BT Prop Trust	   9.89     1.65</p>
<p>11   Gem Property Tr	 9.73     1.44</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 9.71     1.09</p>
<p>13   Villa World	     9.62     1.04</p>
<p>14   Blackmores Lab	  9.41     3.40</p>
<p>15   Gandel Retail Tr	9.29     0.84</p>
<p>16   BTR Plc		   9.08     5.07</p>
<p>17   Central Equity	  8.91     1.01</p>
<p>18   OLS Asia Hldgs	  8.90     0.82</p>
<p>19   Gen Prop Tr	     8.89     2.26</p>
<p>20   Centro Prop	     8.86     2.20</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
